From 88e3a63a4ded28369c995588d87a74ef9d129fbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jul 2024 15:48:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 606/913] dts: stm32: remove activation of RTC nodes for
 stm32mp15 boards.

Remove unnecessary activation of RTC nodes at board level.
RTC is default enabled in stm32MP151.dtsi is already enable at SoC
level.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 1265b25a58dab0c49392f84e3dd97138f1023c1e dts: stm32: remove activation of RTC nodes for stm32mp15 boards.]
Change-Id: I2c3d68a2dedd42e0cac39cc565e74d8dee8c9eac
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/573256
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157d-ed1.dts        | 4 ----
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp157f-ed1.dts        | 4 ----
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dhcom-som.dtsi | 4 ----
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xx-dhcor-som.dtsi | 4 ----
 4 files changed, 16 deletions(-)

